MULTIPLAYER
  TCP/IP multiplayer is supported, and works between Windows, Linux and macOS
  builds of this same release.

If the game reports a renderer problem, the software renderer can be selected
from the in-game Options screen.

Bug reports: https://github.com/EnemyV/EnemyNationsRevival/issues
Include SDL2Panel.log for map-creation problems, or the newest crash .dmp.
